under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see LICENSE.

Changes relative to the original are recorded in the git history of this
repository and summarised in UPSTREAM.md.

The integration uses the pynintendoparental and pynintendoauth libraries,
which are installed separately by Home Assistant and are not part of this
repository.
